  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "嗨，Annette！你能跟我们讲讲这间房子的设计理念吗？",
   "texts": [
    "/ideas/home-furnishings/xiang3-shou4-mao4-xian3-sheng1-huo2-de5-kai1-fang4-shi4-kong1-jian1-shi4-he2-quan2-jia1-ren2-de5-yi1-shi4-gong1-yu4-pube6baf9a0",
    "NO",
    "ikea://cms/page-compatible-web?url=%2Fideas%2Fhome-furnishings%2Fxiang3-shou4-mao4-xian3-sheng1-huo2-de5-kai1-fang4-shi4-kong1-jian1-shi4-he2-quan2-jia1-ren2-de5-yi1-shi4-gong1-yu4-pube6baf9a0&key=cn--zh--e6baf9a0108911ecaacdbbca13c4b88f",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"/ideas/home-furnishings/xiang3-shou4-mao4-xian3-sheng1-huo2-de5-kai1-fang4-shi4-kong1-jian1-shi4-he2-quan2-jia1-ren2-de5-yi1-shi4-gong1-yu4-pube6baf9a0\",\"objectType_var\":\"cms/page-compatible-web\"}",
    "Annette：你好！在设计这个家时，我想呈现一个非常规的生活空间，所以我为这个包括2名少年和父母的四口之家设计了一套开放式阁楼公寓。整个空间热闹欢乐，功能实用，并且借助巧妙的设计，每个人还能拥有自己的空间。",
    "嗨，Annette！你能跟我们讲讲这间房子的设计理念吗？"
   ],
